<title>UK: OFTEL gives more freedom to Mercury.</title>
<headline>OFTEL gives more freedom to Mercury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telecommunications regulators, OFTEL, said on Tuesday it was giving more freedom to Mercury Communications Plc in some international markets by lifting certain regulatory constraints.</p>
</text>
